  "findings": [
    "All Studio tabs have actual model data; TGSlots correctly shows no applicable paylines. Physical strips and independent cell matrices remain distinct.",
    "Lower payout cap/pruning, line editor, dictionary and test evidence are visible through page/internal scrolling, with persistent source status.",
