    "Phone uses page scrolling and internal table/canvas scrolling. Desktop remains the primary authoring surface.",
    "No captured page errors or document overflow. This visual review is separate from browser interaction tests and independent runtime proofs.",
    "Follow-up applied-state review exposed persistent hidden React Flow nodes after Apply: measured dimensions were dropped from controlled nodes. Source 4f18f1f retains measurements in local component state. All 25 affected browsers pass, including visibility after Apply/Undo; current paired machine captures and four extra settled-state captures were inspected. Failure output and screenshot are retained."
